# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The build emits directory-style URLs with a trailing slash and Pages handles
# the non-trailing-slash form itself, so there is no need to enumerate those.
# What is listed here is the canonical-host redirect and a small set of guesses
# a reader might type.

# Common alternative spellings of the tool paths.
/uk/salary          /uk/salary-calculator/          301
/ireland/salary     /ireland/salary-calculator/     301
/australia/salary   /australia/salary-calculator/   301
/new-zealand/salary /new-zealand/salary-calculator/ 301
/canada/salary      /canada/salary-calculator/      301

# Aliases people reach for.
/mortgage           /mortgage-calculators/          301
/salary             /salary-tax-calculators/        301
/tools              /calculators/                   301
/sources.html       /sources/                       301

# The www-to-apex redirect (or the reverse) is configured in the Cloudflare
# dashboard against the real domain, not here — see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md. Adding a
# guessed hostname to this file would create a redirect loop on a domain that
# does not exist yet.
